{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026 香港小姐競選決賽》決賽夜在即，大會今日震撼宣布將斥巨資打造一個結合CG、Motion Graphics及AI視覺技術的沉浸式舞台！據悉，今屆決賽舞台將呈現前所未有的視覺效果，由屢獲大獎的製作團隊匠心打造，究竟這個充滿未來感的奇幻舞台會帶來怎樣的驚喜？</p><p>決賽舞台震撼曝光 CG加AI打造沉浸體驗</p><p>今屆港姐決賽舞台將全面革新，綜合運用CG、Motion Graphics及AI視覺技術，旨在為觀眾營造一個前所未有的沉浸式影像體驗。製作團隊透露，他們會以佳麗們的硬照拍攝為原始素材基礎，再運用AI技術進行視覺延展，配合精密的後期製作、CG視覺效果與Motion Graphics動態設計，共同構築出一個奇幻華麗、且極富層次感的巨型Video Wall，勢要呈現最震撼的視覺效果。</p><p>金獎團隊CID操刀 揭秘兩大核心視覺</p><p>這次的舞台設計再次由屢獲美國紐約電視大獎金獎的頂級製作團隊Creative Imagine Department（CID）匠心打造，品質絕對有保證。CID團隊透露，除了為人矚目的「吉祥神獸」系列外，他們亦運用了同樣的CG、Motion Graphics及AI組合式製作技術，為12位身穿華麗晚裝的佳麗，構築出以「時鐘」為核心概念的虛擬視覺背景，呈現出別具一格的時尚感舞台影像，令人萬分期待。</p><p>網民期待值爆燈：「TVB終於肯揼本！」</p><p>舞台設計概念一經曝光，立即引起網民熱烈討論，輿論普遍表示極度期待。不少網民留言激讚：「今次個台睇落好有誠意，唔再係傳統嗰種！」、「用AI加CG，感覺好似睇緊國際級大騷！」、「終於肯揼本做舞台，值得一讚！」、「好想快啲睇到神獸同佳麗結合嘅畫面會係點！」、「CID出品有保證，今屆決賽必睇！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_13354939546a9259b748035.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_17094900916a9259ba8e55b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_3288251216a9259bfb69e9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_6177378306a9259c3ae46d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_13141663796a9259c6a6d9d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_20108674696a9259ca17db9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_20221952406a9259cdb8a66.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_4891730906a9259d14cb97.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_3406545536a9259d467e0f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_18752447546a9259d74f08d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_13826666046a9259daae7a2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_18338152896a9259de3d1bf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_19333231666a9259e1536fb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_69445376a9259e459912.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_10254574446a9259e74002b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_10740092106a9259eb06d96.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_15938161066a9259f759f5b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19a_18201191606a9259faddfce.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_7920262426a925a000b1b9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_6856737266a925a04138ec.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_11663059166a925a07f11e3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_1965357426a925a0be304f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_3526284026a925a0f41706.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T04:58:30.475848+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":982,"images":23,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}